# 8. Accent Usage

The palette must not become a rainbow.

Use:

```text
Primary action → Blue/Purple
Success → Soft Green
Warning → Orange
Critical → Red
Informational → Blue
Decorative → Pink/Lavender
```

Pink and orange are primarily used for visual warmth.

Blue is used for trust and action.

Purple is used for AI/advanced intelligence.

