Use Material Design principles for:

* spacing
* touch targets
* elevation
* form controls
* dialogs
* snackbars
* navigation
* accessibility

But don't make Quantum Care look like an unmodified Material UI template.

The target aesthetic is:

```text
Material usability
+
Apple-like simplicity
+
Glassmorphism
+
Modern AI interface
```

