# 18. Page Transition

When moving between major patient screens:

```text
Current screen
    ↓
fade + slight upward motion
    ↓
next screen
```

Example:

```css
opacity: 0 → 1
transform: translateY(8px) → 0
```

Duration:

**220ms**

