# 19. Loading States

Never freeze the page.

Use:

* skeleton loaders
* progress indicators
* inline spinners
* upload progress
* AI thinking state

Example:

```text
Analyzing your response...

● ● ○
```

The dots should animate subtly.

---

# 20. No Blocking Spinners

Avoid:

```text
████████████████
Please wait...
```

with the entire interface disabled.

Instead:

```text
Clinical report
─────────────────

Generating your report...

[progress animation]

You can continue when it is ready.
```

Where possible, background processing should leave other safe UI accessible.

