# 58. Accessibility

Patient-facing UI must support:

* keyboard navigation,
* large buttons,
* high contrast,
* readable font sizes,
* visible focus states,
* screen reader labels,
* audio support,
* reduced motion preference,
* voice alternative,
* touch alternative.

Respect:

```text
prefers-reduced-motion
```

When enabled:

```text
Disable:
- background animation
- decorative motion
- long transitions
```

