# 101. Color Semantics

The application must use consistent semantics.

```text
Blue      = primary/information
Purple    = AI
Green     = confirmed/success
Orange    = warning
Red       = urgent/critical
Grey      = neutral
Pink      = patient/health accent
```

Do not change semantic colors between pages.

