# 108. Design for Future Kiosk

Every patient web component that may later become a kiosk component should avoid dependencies on:

* hover,
* keyboard shortcuts,
* tiny controls,
* precise mouse pointers.

Use:

```text
large touch targets
clear spacing
voice alternatives
```

This allows reuse.

