# 110. UI Component Rule

Before adding a new component, check:

```text
Does an existing QC component already do this?
```

If yes:

**reuse it.**

Avoid:

```text
ButtonA
ButtonB
ButtonPrimary2
NewFancyButton
FinalButton
FinalButtonNew
```

That is how design systems become archaeological sites.

